# Line endings are normalised to LF in the repository.
#
# Without this, Git relies on each developer's core.autocrlf setting. On Windows that rewrites files to
# CRLF in the working tree, which makes `git status` report unmodified files as changed — noise that hides
# real changes and invites committing a whole-file rewrite by accident.
#
# The repository already stores LF, so this makes the existing behaviour explicit rather than changing it.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Generated and binary files Git should not try to diff or normalise.
package-lock.json  -diff linguist-generated
*.pdf              binary
*.png              binary
*.jpg              binary
*.webp             binary
*.ico              binary
